<section class="about-info">
      <div class="about-info-container">
        <!-- Top Section  -->
        <div class="about-info_main-text">
          <p>
            <span>Making your own cocktails</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-margarita.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="margarita" class="inline-svg margarita" width="36" height="40" role="presentation">
            <span>from scratch can be a real struggle! And we realize that the cocktail mixers</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-bottle.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="bottle" class="inline-svg bottle" width="24" height="45" role="presentation">
            <span>on the market were all extremely unhealthy, inconveniently sized, and tasted terrible</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-cry-face.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Cry emoji" class="inline-svg cry-face" width="30" height="30" role="presentation"><span>!</span>
          </p>

          <p>
            <span>I mean seriously, who likes that syrupy neon sludge? And that's why we created Craftmix!
            Finally, a cocktail and mocktail mix</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-paloma-simple.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="paloma" class="inline-svg paloma-simple" width="42" height="42" role="presentation">
            <span>that's health-conscious</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-ice-cube.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="ice-cube" class="inline-svg ice-cube" width="49" height="48" role="presentation">
            <span>conveniently sized</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-green.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="green-sachet" class="inline-svg green-sachet" width="29" height="29" role="presentation">
            <span>and most of all, tastes delicious</span>
            <img src="{{ 'about-text-strawberry.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="strawberry" class="inline-svg strawberry" width="32" height="30" role="presentation"><span>!</span>
          </p>
          <br><br>
          <p>
            Finally, a cocktail and mocktail mix that’s health-conscious, conveniently sized and most of all, tastes delicious.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Section  -->
        <div class="about-info_text-and-img">
          
          <div class="image-container" id="video-wrapper" tabindex="0">
            <div class="about-image">
             <video
              id="about-video"
              playsinline
              loop
              poster="{{ section.settings.video_poster | image_url: width: 726 }}"
              preload="none">
              <source src="{{ section.settings.video_url }}" type="video/mp4">
              Your browser does not support the video tag.
            </video>
          
            <!-- Play/Pause Button -->
            <div class="play-btn" id="play-toggle" tabindex="0">
              <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/carousel-card-play-btn.svg?v=1738191527" width="68" height="68" alt="Play" class="play-icon" id="play-icon" loading="lazy">
            </div>
          
              
              <!-- Volume/Mute Button -->
              <div class="volume-btn" id="volume-toggle" tabindex="0">
                <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/Speaker_Icon_7d83b52f-cbca-4d55-ac43-c5293b0d97a4.png?v=1734273205"  width="40" height="40" alt="Volume" class="volume-icon" id="volume-icon" loading="lazy">
                <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/Mute_Icon_77a389ee-8a3a-415f-9dd5-741c7c752fcb.png?v=1734273205"  width="40" height="40" alt="Mute" class="mute-icon" id="mute-icon" style="display: none;" loading="lazy">
              </div>
              
            </div>
          </div>


          
          <div class="image-and-text">
            <div class="text">
              <p>Craftmix was started when JT, an avid entrepreneur and former bartender, realized there was a void in
                the pre-packaged cocktail market. After founding various startups, JT received and overwhelmingly
                positive response to the idea of Craftmix, and he knew this was the one!</p>
              <p>JT, alongside many brave roommates, friends, and team members spent over 6 months testing (getting
                drunk) different flavor combinations and formulas to create the delicious flavors you know.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="img">
              <div class="img-jt_signature">
                <img 
                  src="{{ 'jake-signature-3.png' | asset_url }}" 
                  alt="Jake Signature" 
                  loading="lazy" 
                  width="217" 
                  height="80">
              </div>
              <div class="img-jt">
                <img 
                  src="{{ 'jake-about.png' | asset_url }}" 
                  alt="Jake" 
                  loading="lazy" 
                  width="273" 
                  height="193">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

{% style %}
*,
*::after,
*::before {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* img {
  width: 100%;
} */

.about-info {
  background-color: #ddf7f7;
}
.about-info-container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 20px 20px 20px;
}
/* Top Section */
.about-info_main-text {
  margin: 0 auto;
  margin-bottom: 73px;
  max-width: 780px;
  text-align: center;
}
.about-info_main-text p {
  display: inline-block;
  max-width: 780px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
  color: #002657;
  font-family: 'Hornbill';
  font-size: 1.875rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.79px;
  line-height: 2.75rem;
}

.about-info_main-text p:nth-of-type(2) {
  margin-top: 33px;
}

.inline-svg {
  display: inline-block;
  width: auto; 
  margin: 0 0.2rem; 
  vertical-align: text-bottom; 
}
.inline-svg.margarita {
  height: 40px;
  width: 36px;
  
}
.inline-svg.bottle {
  height: 45px;
  width: 24px;
}
.inline-svg.cry-face {
  height: 30px;
  width: 30px;
}
.inline-svg.paloma-simple {
  height: 42px;
  width: 42px;
}
.inline-svg.ice-cube {
  height: 48px;
  width: 49px;
}
.inline-svg.green-sachet {
  height: 29px;
  width: 29px;
}
.inline-svg.strawberry {
  height: 30px;
  width: 32px;
}

/* Bottom Section */
.about-info_text-and-img {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  margin-bottom: 65px;
}

.image-container {
  max-width: 365px;
  width: 100%;
  margin: 0 auto;
  height: 624px; 
  border-radius: 30px;
}

.about-image {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%; 
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 30px;
  border: 1.5px solid #002657;
}

.about-image video {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.play-btn {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  width: 68px;
  height: 68px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}

.play-btn img {
  width: 68px;
  height: 68px;
}

.volume-btn {
  position: absolute;
  top: 10px;
  right: 10px;
  background-color: #fff;
  border-radius: 50%;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  border: 2px solid rgba(0, 38, 87, 1);
}

.volume-btn img {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
}



.image-and-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 72px;
}

.image-and-text .text {
  max-width: 499px;
}
.image-and-text .text p {
  opacity: 0.9;
  color: #002657;
  font-family: 'Goldplay';
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: -0.11px;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 1.5rem;
}

.image-and-text .text p:first-of-type {
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.img-jt_signature img {
  width: 217px;
  /* height: 38px; */
}
.img-jt img {
  width: 273px;
  height: 193px;
}

/* Media query for desktop */
